  "lesson": {
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "meta": "交互解题 · 体积最小值",
    "title": "四棱锥 $P$-$ABCD$ 中，$\\triangle PAB$ 为直角三角形，且它在平面 $PDC$ 上的投影恰为 $\\triangle PDC$。已知 $PC=3$，$PD=4$，$CD=5$，求四棱锥 $P$-$ABCD$ 体积的最小值",
    "answerLabel": "体积的最小值",
    "answerValue": "$12 \\sqrt{2}$"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "title": "由 $3$-$4$-$5$ 与投影条件建系",
      "content": "<p>底面 $ABCD$ 在 $z=0$。$PC=3$、$PD=4$、$CD=5$，故 $\\triangle PDC$ 直角在 $P$。把 $C$ 放原点、$CD$ 沿 $x$ 轴，并取 $P$ 在 $xz$ 平面：</p>$$C(0,0,0),\\ D(5,0,0),\\ P\\left(\\dfrac{9}{5},0,\\dfrac{12}{5}\\right).$$<p>$\\triangle PAB$ 在平面 $PDC$ 上的投影恰为 $\\triangle PDC$，故 $A$、$B$ 在该平面上的射影分别是 $C$、$D$，于是 $AC\\perp$ 平面 $PDC$、$BD\\perp$ 平面 $PDC$。</p>",
      "highlight": [
        "Axis",
        "Plane_ABCD",
        "Plane_PDC",
        "Len_PC",
        "Len_PD",
        "Len_CD",
        "Point_P",
        "Point_C",
        "Point_D"
      ],
      "cameraPos": {
        "x": 15.16,
        "y": 8.43,
        "z": 9.04
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "用高度参数表示底面",
      "content": "<p>平面 $PDC$ 的法向量沿 $y$ 轴，故</p>$$A=(0,h_1,0),\\quad B=(5,h_2,0).$$<p>为使底面是凸四边形，$h_1$、$h_2$ 同号。底面积为 $\\dfrac{5}{2}(|h_1|+|h_2|)$，$P$ 到底面距离 $\\dfrac{12}{5}$，体积</p>$$V=2(|h_1|+|h_2|).$$",
      "highlight": [
        "Point_A",
        "Point_B",
        "Point_C",
        "Point_D",
        "Plane_ABCD",
        "Line_AC",
        "Line_BD"
      ],
      "cameraPos": {
        "x": 11.77,
        "y": 9.92,
        "z": 12.16
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "情形一：直角在 $A$",
      "content": "<p>$\\overrightarrow{PA}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AB}=0$ 化成 $h_1(h_2-h_1)=9$。取 $h_1>0$、$h_2>0$，则 $h_2=h_1+\\dfrac{9}{h_1}$，</p>$$V=2\\left(2h_1+\\dfrac{9}{h_1}\\right)\\ge 12\\sqrt{2},$$<p>当 $h_1=\\dfrac{3\\sqrt{2}}{2}$、$h_2=\\dfrac{9\\sqrt{2}}{2}$ 时等号成立。图中实线底面 $ABCD$ 就是这一款。</p>",
      "highlight": [
        "Plane_PAB",
        "Plane_ABCD",
        "Point_P",
        "Point_A",
        "Point_B",
        "Len_PA",
        "Len_AB",
        "Line_AC",
        "Line_BD"
      ],
      "cameraPos": {
        "x": 10.93,
        "y": 12.59,
        "z": 9.56
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "情形二：直角在 $B$",
      "content": "<p>$\\overrightarrow{PB}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{BA}=0$ 化成 $h_2(h_1-h_2)=16$，$h_1=h_2+\\dfrac{16}{h_2}$，</p>$$V=2\\left(2h_2+\\dfrac{16}{h_2}\\right)\\ge 16\\sqrt{2},$$<p>当 $h_2=2\\sqrt{2}$、$h_1=6\\sqrt{2}$ 时等号成立。图中虚线底面 $A'B'CD$ 就是这一款，比情形一大。直角在 $P$ 时更大。故全局最小为 $12 \\sqrt{2}$。</p>",
      "highlight": [
        "Plane_PApBp",
        "Plane_ApBpCD",
        "Point_P",
        "Point_Ap",
        "Point_Bp",
        "Line_ApC",
        "Line_BpD"
      ],
      "cameraPos": {
        "x": 12.93,
        "y": 11.07,
        "z": 9.27
      }
    }
  ],
